    https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
    Extracts are redistributed by Geofabrik GmbH. Any database derived from
    OSM and shared publicly must itself be offered under the ODbL.

  NASA MOD13Q1 vegetation indices
    NASA LP DAAC / ORNL DAAC. Public domain, attribution requested.

  Open-Meteo (air quality, weather, ERA5 reanalysis)
    CC BY 4.0. https://open-meteo.com/en/license

  ISRIC SoilGrids v2.0
    CC BY 4.0. https://soilgrids.org

  Esri World Imagery / Google Street View
    Displayed under their respective terms of service. Used for visual
    verification only; no derived data is computed from their pixels and
    none is redistributed here.

  Central Pollution Control Board, National Air Quality Index
    Breakpoints transcribed from CUPS/82/2014-15, Table 3.11, published by
    the Ministry of Environment, Forest and Climate Change, Government of
    India.
